    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_pass_registration_listener" kindref="compound">PassRegistrationListener</ref> class - This class is meant to be derived from by clients that are interested in which passes get registered and unregistered at runtime (which can be because of the <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_register_pass" kindref="compound">RegisterPass</ref> constructors being run as the program starts up, or may be because a shared object just got loaded). </para>
    </briefdescription>
